# NAT ALONE's encore at The Grand Flush's goal, for `scripts/record-run --capture` (format:
# src/capture/timeline.rs). Start on the plunger's stage, right of the beat crushers:
#   NATHAN_SOLO=10 NATHAN_START=507 scripts/record-run --capture out.mp4 scripts/tours/encore-solo.timeline
# To the goal flag (ENCORE!), then show off in the lap under the ceiling: call the band (Down)
# again and again and hop about (Giant Steps bumps the ceiling). The Basie ending's last chord:
# the duck bounces Nat up through the grate, Han pops out of the throne below, SLAM. ~40 s.

wait 1

# To the goal flag: ENCORE!
hold Right 400ms
wait 0.5

# Giant Steps: float up to the ceiling and back.
tap Down
wait 0.4
repeat 2
  hold Space 160ms
  wait 250ms
  hold Space 160ms
  wait 1.1
end

# Fired up: dash about right of the crushers.
tap Down
wait 0.3
hold Right 300ms
hold Left 300ms
hold Right Space 250ms
wait 0.6

# Melting, more calls, hopping on the spot.
tap Down
wait 0.5
repeat 3
  hold Space 200ms
  wait 300ms
end
tap Down
wait 0.4
hold Space 160ms
wait 250ms
hold Space 160ms
wait 0.8
tap Down
wait 0.4
hold Left 150ms

# The lap ends; the band's ending, the duck, up through the grate, Han, SLAM, to be continued.
wait 19
